                "annotations": [],
                "text": "Based on SEC EDGAR data:\n\n**1. Tesla Q3 2025 net income ~ $1.4 billion - CORRECT**\n\n* Tesla, Inc. (TSLA) - `NetIncomeLoss`\n* Q3 2025: 2025-07-01 to 2025-09-30\n* Value: **$1,373,000,000**\n* Form: 10-Q, 92 days, period_type = quarter\n\n$1.373B rounds to about $1.4B.\n\n**2. Alphabet Q4 2024 revenue exceeded $100 billion - INCORRECT**\n\n* Alphabet Inc. (GOOGL) - `RevenueFromContractWithCustomerExcludingAssessedTax`\n* Q4 2024: 2024-10-01 to 2024-12-31\n* Value: **$96,469,000,000** - derived as FY2024 - 9M YTD\n  * FY2024: $350,018,000,000\n  * 9M YTD to 2024-09-30: $253,549,000,000\n* 92 days, period_type = quarter\n\n$96.469B is **below** $100B, so it did not exceed $100B.\n",
